{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_asxtpoqjpqpw3nyd7mqgia26z2qeylhd4evgyyvjyowygrrcvjma","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01GCi5RK5a6YUvR5Kr9yVRB3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"set -e\nrun_mut () {\n  desc=\"$1\"; py=\"$2\"\n  cp \"$TMPDIR/lib.rs.bak\" src/lib.rs\n  python3 -c \"$py\"\n  echo \"--- MUTATION: $desc ---\"\n  timeout 300 cargo test --offline --test valid_paths 2>&1 | grep -E \"^test result\" || true\n}\nrun_mut \"return 34 -> 35\" \"\np='src/lib.rs'; s=open(p).read(); assert '    34\\n}' in s\nopen(p,'w').write(s.replace('    34\\n}','    35\\n}',1))\"\nrun_mut \"scan loop off-by-one\" \"\np='src/lib.rs'; s=open(p).read()\nopen(p,'w').write(s.replace('while ptr < end && unsafe { *ptr } != 0 {','while ptr < end.wrapping_sub(1) && unsafe { *ptr } != 0 {',1))\"\nrun_mut \"drop final dst[0]=0 store\" \"\np='src/lib.rs'; s=open(p).read()\nopen(p,'w').write(s.replace('    // dst[0] = 0;\\n    unsafe { *dst = 0 };','    // dst[0] = 0;',1))\"\nrun_mut \"wrapping_add -> add on end\" \"\np='src/lib.rs'; s=open(p).read()\nopen(p,'w').write(s.replace('let end: *mut wchar_t = dst.wrapping_add(num_elem);','let end: *mut wchar_t = dst.wrapping_offset(num_elem as isize).wrapping_offset(0);',1))\"\ncp \"$TMPDIR/lib.rs.bak\" src/lib.rs\ndiff \"$TMPDIR/lib.rs.bak\" src/lib.rs && echo \"RESTORED-IDENTICAL\"","description":"Run mutation battery to validate harness"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":281,"cache_read_input_tokens":84743,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":281,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"665ffee4-01f9-4fcf-be0a-78d2d67f6671","uuid":"d6c62e37-673b-4829-8a42-a6be5c139345","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:45:54.637Z"}
